mode: "100644"
header: "---\nname: jake-seed-seed-plan\ndescription: \"Business Planner. Turns your idea into a business plan investors can read: the nine sections (executive summary, problem, solution, market, competition, business model, go-to-market, financial plan, use of funds), written with you, with the numbers pulled from the other seed skills' files: TAM, SAM and SOM from seed/market.json, competitors' weak points from seed/competitors.json, revenue, breakeven and runway from seed/model.json. Computes the unit economics (take rate, contribution per order, CAC payback, LTV:CAC) and flags empty sections and numbers that disagree between files. Writes seed/config.json, seed/plan.json and seed/plan.md. Use when the user says \\\"turn my idea into a business plan\\\", \\\"write my business plan\\\", \\\"I have a startup idea\\\", \\\"help me plan my startup\\\", \\\"check my plan\\\", \\\"unit economics\\\", or before /seed-deck.\"\nlicense: MIT\nmetadata:\n  upstream_repository: Jakeschincariol/seed-skill\n  upstream_skill: seed-plan\n  upstream_commit: fde88957238bd3bc28e80e1fe0b252a64507b108\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
